        <mxCell id="bvmbdEyvr91BFZFNNsc6-82" parent="1" style="ellipse;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;shapeInside=1;fontSize=14;" value="BookID" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="60" width="100" x="895" y="430" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="bvmbdEyvr91BFZFNNsc6-83" parent="1" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;rounded=0;fontSize=27;fontStyle=1" value="Chen ERD 2 - Book Inventory" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="107.5" width="210" x="1375" y="368.75" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="bvmbdEyvr91BFZFNNsc6-86" edge="1" parent="1" source="bvmbdEyvr91BFZFNNsc6-84" style="edgeStyle=none;rounded=0;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;exitX=1;exitY=1;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0.25;entryY=0;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;strokeColor=default;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=12;fontColor=default;labelBackgroundColor=default;defaultLabelBackgroundColor=page;endArrow=none;endFill=0;" target="bvmbdEyvr91BFZFNNsc6-55">
          <mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="bvmbdEyvr91BFZFNNsc6-84" parent="1" style="ellipse;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;shapeInside=1;fontSize=14;" value="ShelfCode" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="60" width="100" x="1375" y="90" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="bvmbdEyvr91BFZFNNsc6-87" parent="1" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;roundedPerimeter=1;" value="&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 26px;&quot;&gt;TEAM: HEXAGON&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;line-height: 115%;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;&quot;&gt;Kim Anastasiya&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;line-height: 115%;&quot;&gt;Tyo Stanislav&lt;br&gt;Azimova Nigina&lt;br&gt;Magay Sara&lt;br&gt;2026 SAaD project&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 19px;&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="250" width="340" x="1785" y="823.75" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="bvmbdEyvr91BFZFNNsc6-88" parent="1" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;roundedPerimeter=1;align=center;fontSize=15;verticalAlign=middle;" value="&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 19px;&quot;&gt;Chen ERD 1 - Book Catalog:&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;&lt;/span&gt;The Book Catalog ERD describes how bibliographic information is organized. Books are associated with authors and classified into categories, allowing users to search for books by title, author, ISBN, or category. The model represents book titles independently from physical copies.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 19px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 19px;&quot;&gt;Chen ERD 2 - Book Inventory:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 19px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(#000000, var(--ge-light-color, #ffffff));&quot;&gt;The Book Inventory ERD distinguishes book titles from individual physical copies. Each copy has a unique identifier, barcode, status, and shelf location. This distinction allows the library to track available, borrowed, damaged, and retired copies separately.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 19px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(#000000, var(--ge-light-color, #ffffff));&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 19px;&quot;&gt;Chen ERD 3 - Members and Staff:&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(#000000, var(--ge-light-color, #ffffff));&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 19px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(#000000, var(--ge-light-color, #ffffff));&quot;&gt;The Members and Staff ERD models library members and authorized employees. Members are registered by staff, while staff accounts are assigned access roles. This separation supports member management and role-based access without requiring members to have online login accounts.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 19px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(#000000, var(--ge-light-color, #ffffff));&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 19px;&quot;&gt;Chen ERD 4 - Book Circulation:&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 19px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(#000000, var(--ge-light-color, #ffffff));&quot;&gt;The Book Circulation ERD represents borrowing and returning transactions. Each loan belongs to one member and one physical copy and is processed by library staff. Borrow dates, due dates, return dates, and loan status allow the system to identify active, returned, and overdue loans.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="470" width="885" x="1645" y="40" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
      </root>
    </mxGraphModel>
  </diagram>
</mxfile>
